This directory is setup as a temporary solution for HPS project.

There two distinct types of files:
 * third_party/hps_accel/cfu.h - file copied from the script CFU-Playground/proj/hps_accel/gateware/constants.py.
 * all other third_party/hps_accel/*.{cc, h} - files copies from CFU-Playground/proj/hps_accel/src/ directory.

Notes:
 * Test files are not copied from CFU-Playground/proj/hps_accel/src/ directory.

---

How to update TensorFlow Lite Micro with custom kernels?

1. Copy / Paste (or replace) CFU-Playground files (tensorflow/lite/kernels/internal/reference/integer_ops/).
2. Update the imports to `#include "hps_accel/.." for CFU .h files.
3. (optional) Comment out the print methods in custom kernels, as they print libraries are not included in the shim.